<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡσῠχ-ῇ</span></b>  (with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ι</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>PHib.</u>
			1.73.6
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <u>PCair.Zen.</u> (v. infr.)), 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡσῠχ-ᾶ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stilly, quietly, softly,
			gently</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				11.55
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ. κατακεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					692
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετέρχεσθαί τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					444
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχ᾽ ἡ</span>. keep <i>quiet!</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
				298c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ. ἔχειν τὴν οὐράν</span> to
			keep it <i>still</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ. γελάσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					115c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοσμίως πάντα πράττειν καὶ
			ἡ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				159b
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ. ἀναμιμνήσκεσθαι</span>
			to recollect <i>quietly, at one's ease</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσεβεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					286.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>by stealth, secretly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				2.9.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to some extent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Her.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <i>slightly</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύλλον
				περικεχαραγμένον ἡ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.14.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βηχίον ἡ. ξηρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					4.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					14.10
				</span></i>
			 (prob. l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόσιμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
					76.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακροπρόσωπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PStrassb.</u>
					87.11
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνερευθές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.131
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ αὐχένος εἰς εὐώνυμον ἡ.
					κεκλιμένου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρυπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					3.28
				</span></i>
			.</div>
